{
  "key": 13379,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000294_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "What do you want?\n",
        "You’re investigating the explosion?\r",
        "Bah, it doesn’t matter who you are.\n",
        "It’s too late to make any difference.\r",
        "Things are going to get really\n",
        "interesting now.\r",
        "All the legendary Pokémon are going\n",
        "to be brought to our HQ in Veilstone!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000294_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Even Team Galactic has no use for\n",
        "MAGIKARP! Worthless, all of them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000294_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Hahaha!\n",
        "Next stop, Lake Verity!\r",
        "The closest civilization is that hick\n",
        "town called Twinleaf!\r",
        "We can roll in there completely\n",
        "unopposed!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000294_00003",
      "en_US": "A MAGIKARP is weakly flopping about..."
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeValorDrained_Text_Arc2FenceSign",
      "en_US": [
        "VALOR BASIN\r",
        "Keep out. Unstable ground."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeValorDrained_Text_Arc2GariusDont",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Don't. Just don't,\n",
        "okay?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeValorDrained_Text_Arc2GariusLooker",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What?\n",
        "Looker sent you?\r",
        "...Fine. Tell him I'll be there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeValorDrained_Text_Arc2GariusQuestion",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey. If someone told\n",
        "you they could fix the worst thing\r",
        "that ever happened to you...\r",
        "and all it cost was telling them\n",
        "stuff nobody'd miss...\r",
        "Would you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeValorDrained_Text_Arc2GariusYes",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Yeah. Me too."
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeValorDrained_Text_Arc2GariusNo",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Must be nice."
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeValorDrained_Text_Arc2GariusAfter",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeValorDrained_Text_Arc2GariusDad",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Dad used to row me\n",
        "out here. Right about... there.\r",
        "He'd say the lake was the only\n",
        "thing in Sinnoh that held still.\r",
        "...Then it didn't."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
